WEBVTT

00:02:58.375 --> 00:03:00.101
they will always tell you

00:03:00.125 --> 00:03:03.708
that the secret to closing a sale
is the conversation.

00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:07.417
People want to buy from other people.

00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:11.434
So why do we forget
this most crucial ingredient

00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:13.083
when we shop online?

00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:20.309
This impersonal, anonymous experience
is leaving many of us less satisfied.

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:22.559
Returns are at an all-time high,

00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:24.184
and we're left feeling --

00:03:24.208 --> 00:03:25.768
did I buy too much?

00:03:25.792 --> 00:03:27.351
Did I buy too little?

00:03:27.375 --> 00:03:29.434
Does it really look good on me?

00:03:29.458 --> 00:03:31.018
Did I even need this?